{c: Verse 1}
[F][A#]Ek Ajnabi Hasina Se
[C][F]Yun Mulaaqat Ho Gayi
[F][A#]Phir Kya Hua Ye Na Puchho
[C][F]kuch aisi bat ho gai

[Dm]Wo Achanak Aa Gayi
[Dm][C]Yun Nazar Ke Saamne
[G][C][F]Jaise Nikal Aaya Ghata se chand
[A#][C]Chehre Pe Zulfen
[Dm][F]Bikhri Hui Thi
[A#][C][F][A#][F]Din Mein Raat Ho Gayi

[Dm]Jane man jane jigar
[Dm][C]Hota mai shayar agar
[G][C][F]Kehta gazal teri adaon par
[A#][C]Maine ye kaha to
[Dm][F]Mujse khafa wo
[A#][C][F][A#][F]Jaane hayaa ho gayi

[Dm]Khubsurat baat ye
[Dm][C]Char pal ka saath ye
[G][C][F]Sari umar mujko rahega yaad
[A#][C]Mai akela tha magar
[Dm][F]Ban gai wo hamsafar
[A#][C][F][A#][F]Wo mere sath ho gayi
